    "description": "# BA-4: CMS Identity Fields\n\n_CMS-sourced identity fields on the BA record — read-only, created upstream via the CMS._\n\n### FIELDS\n\n* BA External ID\n\n* Needed for mapping — Kobi Kunasekaran, [1:04:16](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=3856): \"We're planning on using that for the mapping, but the rest is optional.\"\n\n* BA Slug\n* Primary Agency Site — renamed from Landing Page\n\n* Joyce Kiddell, [1:04:56](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=3896): \"Can we change it from landing page to agency?\" Lina Ceniccola, [1:05:00](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=3900): \"Agency site? Yep.\"\n\n### IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS\n\n* Copy-to-clipboard for these fields is deferred — don't build it\n\n* Emily Vandenberg, [1:07:13](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=4033): \"No, let's just make it as simple as we can right now.\"\n\n* Section stays read-only\n\n* BAs are created upstream via the CMS, same as Player.\n\n### NOTES\n\n* Provenance: BA-4 (Brand Ambassador Record User Stories doc).\n\n### SOURCE\n\n* [Taryn doc BA-4 — Brand Ambassador Record User Stories](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MsJXwt3oY-DyQuAdMzNYlyPenKUQl7g8mHzMmeRaVHs/edit?tab=t.g64hrhse8pog)\n* [Aug 18 Weekly Sync — Kobi Kunasekaran, 1:04:16 (External ID for mapping)](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=3856)\n* [Aug 18 Weekly Sync — Joyce Kiddell, 1:04:56 (renames to Agency Site)](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=3896)\n* [Aug 18 Weekly Sync — Lina Ceniccola, 1:05:00 (confirms)](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=3900)\n* [Aug 18 Weekly Sync — Emily Vandenberg, 1:07:13 (copy-to-clipboard deferred)](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=4033)\n* Dependencies: [BUILD-202 — Brand Ambassador: Object + Core Status](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693577680227/f/)\n* Owner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n* Created 2026-08-20 from Brand Ambassador record documentation review.\n\n",
